{"title":"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 33","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The perimeter of an isosceles right triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/c/72c9925c5c9c964c4a3ab50d7516202c1e614310.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" />. Its area is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/f/65f38a45ab6e6693f959e1d5aa8a24d1e1c0a3d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ (2+\\sqrt{2})p \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ (2-\\sqrt{2})p \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ (3-2\\sqrt{2})p^2\\\\  \\textbf{(D)}\\ (1-2\\sqrt{2})p^2\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ (3+2\\sqrt{2})p^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"421\" height=\"45\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given leg length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, we can write the perimeter of this triangle to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/c/3bcaf9e2adb3d6138ee9e4e6b803c2fda8ef8977.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x+x\\sqrt{2}=2p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"118\" height=\"20\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/f/f1f5e59ca8ab712d4c4e1e47245eec269662b30c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x(2+\\sqrt{2})=2p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"122\" height=\"21\" />. Divide to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/0/270cdf86ff6a84f0746c2281a5d644110f5fb98f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{2p}{2+\\sqrt{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"92\" height=\"41\" />. Multiply by the conjugate and simplify to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/a/2eae1a67f0f77806bbcd9299e36d8ee6bc212c4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=p(2-\\sqrt{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"112\" height=\"21\" />. Square and divide by two to get the area of the triangle, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/8/fb817dc2a1b775e9f5dd8c52fdd02b188b0077d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{p^2*(2-\\sqrt{2}^2)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"113\" height=\"44\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/6/0d6c473336f2ec2c56d6647448310e36513f0769.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p^2(3-2\\sqrt{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"21\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME\" title=\"1953 AHSME\">1953 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1953 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1953\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">Problem 32</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">Problem 34</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1